{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_title", "source_sha256": "093604c09dedc11ea4fdb3d4c1d3d4806513af70f2b9afe98a0bd5d8cff268fc", "ja": "陽だまりの花のように", "zh": "犹如艳阳下的花朵", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_synopsis", "source_sha256": "9e73962948aef4c7ef1d22e2bd5ec493161bf992d7aa98f15e53038e79784433", "ja": "立候補したものの、どんな公演にしようかと\n悩む美也。海美、朋花と向かった公園で、\n律子と貴音に会う。美也はみんなとの\n会話の中から、自分らしいステージの\nヒントを見つけ出す。", "zh": "美也虽然毛遂自荐，\n却苦恼该展现什么样的公演。\n此时她与海美、朋花一起前往公园，\n在那里遇见律子与贵音。与大家聊天时，\n美也发现了让舞台充满自我风格的提示。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50befab9dbe52811630491c43849976af078fdbb9a26d97b1e12880ff97d8c19", "ja": "（美也、かなり張りきっていたな。ステージプランも\n考えてみたいというから任せたが、大丈夫だろうか？）", "zh": "（美也相当有干劲呢。她还说想尝试拟定舞台计划，\n我就交给她包办了，应该不会有问题吧？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1001_029umi", "source_sha256": "2aa346f7ed0e8d86c9b3db1ab12a4b06364674d534e4b1eee7f52a6b715bcfc9", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nナイスタイミングっ！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你来得正好！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1002_p", "source_sha256": "079491547c5b712464ab26a7fc432058404caea308dfe719074746df217d50c0", "ja": "海美、お疲れさま。\nナイスタイミングって、どうかしたのか？", "zh": "海美，辛苦了。\n你说我来得正好，是发生什么事了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1003_029umi", "source_sha256": "8da6700304ac8e0f35020ecb27d4a5f3c29536df895da81512ce139769d1b72c", "ja": "あのさ、美也知らない？　さっきからずっと\n探してるんだけど、どこにもいないんだよ～。", "zh": "那个啊，你有看到美也吗？\n我从刚才就一直在找她，但到处都找不到人～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8b65994c0161de5717086de4380d16cffb33604d62630620e6ae214cff41185e", "ja": "いや、今日はまだ見てないが……。", "zh": "没有耶，我今天还没看见她……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1005_029umi", "source_sha256": "327b2e83ca0d1f0e228629e69426fe3b5b2f91bc5b81c06ce9fb8127fbdefa55", "ja": "そっか～、どこいっちゃったのかな？\nレッスンルームにもいなかったし……。", "zh": "这样啊～她会跑去哪里呢？\n她也不在练习室……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1006_029umi", "source_sha256": "1541026484639f657a0fae68d16802260a6142d24f630ffc8fb8076f5253d10e", "ja": "あ！　別に、急ぎとかじゃないんだよ？　ただ今日の\nレッスン、私と朋花様も付き合おうかな～と思って。", "zh": "啊！我并不是有什么急事要找她喔。\n只是想说今天我跟朋花大人也来陪她一起练习好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1007_029umi", "source_sha256": "2143668ee7bdf2d0f1079420d655cff50c36bdce0141224d5a72c9a7a8d6f6d1", "ja": "次の公演、私達も一緒に出てほしいって、\n美也に言われたんだ！　だから……。", "zh": "美也说希望我们也一起参加下次的公演！\n所以……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1008_p", "source_sha256": "24d912cb605fdf5d7eb912424af973a26abc9c8ba8e7be0fc2e3c57d9262380d", "ja": "そうだったのか。それなら、\nますますレッスンルームにいそうだけど……。", "zh": "原来是这样。\n既然如此，她更应该会在练习室才对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "46ed7b96602ca21dcded0efb1ffbe34f3fdc75f5eb16d13f7f0a3ecad612c0c4", "ja": "海美さん～。あら、{$P$}さんも。\n美也さんがどこにいるか、わかりましたよ～？", "zh": "海美～哎呀，{$P$}先生也在。\n我知道美也在哪里了喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1010_029umi", "source_sha256": "95c73c4539380a3876f3e2b720f415b98baf56b7176f40b052be58b0f38821c3", "ja": "えっ！　朋花様、ホント！？", "zh": "咦！朋花大人，是真的吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1011_031tom", "source_sha256": "47aebc2594c7ccc2fee4d78d3f318099896043118d4472c05ea0846d51efd745", "ja": "ええ、今は事務室にいるみたいです～。\n美咲さんが教えてくれました～。", "zh": "是呀，她现在好像在事务室～\n是美咲姊告诉我的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1012_p", "source_sha256": "69bf031eeeb7d2446ecddf468df9894e26319ee74b718df0efd501b33ed2f152", "ja": "そうか、ありがとう朋花。\n俺も美也と話したい事があるし、一緒に行くよ。", "zh": "这样啊，谢谢你，朋花。\n我也有事想跟美也谈，就跟你们一起去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1013_029umi", "source_sha256": "921585c596c39d427005ed92610619fe52bb7001dd6579756f2038d0df3e5d93", "ja": "うん！　行こう、{$P$}！", "zh": "嗯！我们走吧，{$P$}！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1014_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1015_042miy", "source_sha256": "6e4a1d2b06b2daec2a1e4e335b5773eb73432dfc2125ef54980608caa6c81ad5", "ja": "む～ん……。\n囲碁も楽しいけど、将棋も捨てがたいですな～。", "zh": "唔～嗯……\n围棋很好玩，但我也舍不得将棋啊～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1016_029umi", "source_sha256": "28ca5a077527626e99e8629f46eb29a880d87b7d7a4227ccf94337a5fc5ee011", "ja": "美也～、探したんだよ～！　……って、わわっ！？\n何か置いてある……囲碁？　こっちは将棋？", "zh": "美也～我们一直在找你喔～！……呃，哇哇！？\n地上摆了什么东西……围棋？这边的是将棋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1017_042miy", "source_sha256": "9b47b7a7a348ce5947037d53e42b2923b053c53d35b57a7aa397ae712a8bad64", "ja": "あ、海美ちゃん、朋花ちゃん。\n{$P$}さんも、お疲れさまです～。", "zh": "啊，海美、朋花。\n{$P$}先生也来啦，辛苦了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1018_031tom", "source_sha256": "32bbb7fc4433c83c7dd73550a2ddb500cd298056ab4d0a0b1d5d11e0f45db070", "ja": "部屋が、色々な物で溢れ返っていますね～。\n美也さんの私物でしょうか～？", "zh": "房间里面摆满好多东西～\n这都是美也的私人物品吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1019_029umi", "source_sha256": "25bd43ead50b68156d55ea8cf2edd627d1e9fdd69fdcacea466501911bc95353", "ja": "こっちはアルバム？　わっ、カワイイ！\nこのアルバムに写ってる女の子って、美也？", "zh": "这是相簿？哇，好可爱！\n这本相簿里的女孩子是美也吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1020_042miy", "source_sha256": "07681df7e7885ee179a6abf3d063d8e570f198e48a11f4030796a751b86ddeab", "ja": "はい～。\n小さいころの私ですよ～。", "zh": "是的～\n是小时候的我喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1021_p", "source_sha256": "62a565c98ed1b94be2e4d689070f6d5d7f6dedfa589626124644cbec72084b28", "ja": "美也、これはいったい……？", "zh": "美也，这到底是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1022_042miy", "source_sha256": "f3de15fd0f7f1f56c60767f789f93f111f52bf5dc91c5ca65cb1c70288da3285", "ja": "これは、私の宝物なんです～。\n次の公演について、考えてるんですよ～。", "zh": "这些是我的宝物～\n我正在思考下次公演的事～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1023_029umi", "source_sha256": "881c2391e47cf258620723a54e2facded58329c7f22e3797663c301a8d0a520b", "ja": "ん？\n宝物を見ながら、次の公演について考えるの？", "zh": "嗯？\n你是在边看宝物边思考下次公演的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1024_042miy", "source_sha256": "8bbc96baab98d98a357a1c2045e998952b9436c9f65f2d05b5459009bb8ca8e2", "ja": "はい～。今度の公演は、きっと、\n私の宝物になると思うんです～。", "zh": "是的～我觉得这次的公演，\n一定会成为我的宝物～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1025_042miy", "source_sha256": "79c7e0770121a6deef243a05cc46b2a787ffd783d3fef5a66deabacdb10de97c", "ja": "なので……宝物を見ながら考えたら、\nいいアイディアが浮かぶかと思いまして～。", "zh": "所以……我想说边看宝物边思考，\n说不定会想到好主意～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "290fc659711e33ab5d3d809ff5ee34759ee0c898afea845caa3d0654e6d6be33", "ja": "美也さんの宝物と同じくらい、素敵な公演に\nしたいという、気持ちの表れでしょうか～？", "zh": "美也是想打造出与这些宝物一样棒的公演，\n所以这份心情就呈现在行动上了吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1027_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee7c798c4356058b40bddaa479ab37c86e7a112aef0594b1155cbf35c8f162c3", "ja": "そういうことになりますかね～？", "zh": "应该就是这样吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1028_p", "source_sha256": "15fb3fce248d018bae528b4b332a504e9a882ea155109f0c64314e8b0a11cdca", "ja": "それで私物をたくさん持ってきていたのか……。\nで、何かいい案は思いついたのか？", "zh": "所以你才拿了这么多私人物品过来啊……\n那你想到什么好主意了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1029_042miy", "source_sha256": "f263f6190c2ff63e2569e05e234262eee4b242660380fa384c26bd34ca917655", "ja": "それが、まだなんです～。\nコンセプトというのは、難しいですな～。", "zh": "其实啊，我还没想到～\n要构思主题还真难呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1030_031tom", "source_sha256": "337bcf4bbbc7b62160363b6400135e3b0534dc32236a9c3398cc9882ae3cbfd9", "ja": "コンセプトも大事ですが、あまりのんびりしていると、\n公演が始まってしまいますよ～？", "zh": "主题固然很重要，\n但要是太拖拖拉拉，公演就要开始了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "d305980ad0ad0df628de0012116266e94eb829e6674a3a80d19370822afa88b1", "ja": "そろそろレッスンだけでも、\n始めておいたほうが良いのではありませんか～？", "zh": "时间也不多了，\n至少先开始练习比较好吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1032_042miy", "source_sha256": "a3e8232c0e1c84fa93747d47772980ab81e3203f2df0ad1b3f4ef1dc01e659c2", "ja": "う～ん……そうですね～。", "zh": "唔～嗯……说得也是呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1033_029umi", "source_sha256": "798efbccdf0319b5c9b4eac5aa1d157682b34e2711e7999f22d7f8b8edaa1650", "ja": "あ、だったら今からレッスンしようよ！\n体を動かしたら、きっと頭もスッキリするよ☆", "zh": "啊，那我们现在就开始练习吧！\n只要活动身体，思绪一定也会变清晰喔☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1034_042miy", "source_sha256": "a2c748fe75145d2cde5f4f8c7ec48763ed130990b1ebef17704c15035f4a4df3", "ja": "なるほど、わかりました～。それでは……。", "zh": "原来如此，我明白了～那么……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1035_042miy", "source_sha256": "cf9bba6328bebd64ba264b113018c484b1408ce680ce756c2fe6a3307677e95b", "ja": "今日はとてもお天気がいいので、\nみんなで公園に、お散歩に行きませんか～？", "zh": "今天天气非常好，\n大家要不要一起去公园散步呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1036_029umi", "source_sha256": "06afa4462c3df80dc9ae350cadf7b2ae82ec1bc8628e49334a0251e991f2fe82", "ja": "わああ、公園でレッす……\nあれ、お散歩？　レッスンじゃなくて？", "zh": "哇啊啊，在公园练……\n呃，散步？不是去练习吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1037_042miy", "source_sha256": "8c58a9f4882ac3f1920e81891c0704ecb1a7bcc327c86eb7de96f6ad465fd278", "ja": "はい～。お散歩をしながら、少し考えてみようかと～。\nそれでは、出発しんこ～♪", "zh": "是的～我想在散步时试着思考一下～\n那么，出发前进～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1038_p", "source_sha256": "5876bce2606abf28f857959fcdf63db91bce31197741bf7df2fd66a1ea852276", "ja": "（朋花のいうことも理にかなっている。でも……\nここは美也に任せてみよう）", "zh": "（朋花说的话也有道理。\n但是……这里就试着交给美也吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1039_029umi", "source_sha256": "f87f3cb74f83d3b4889eca9abd027e825f209ab5d5da951a4cedc0e7c09fd358", "ja": "うわーっ、ホントにいい天気っ！\n外に出てきて、正解だったかもだねっ？", "zh": "哇啊～天气真的好好喔！\n出来外面说不定是正确的呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1040_031tom", "source_sha256": "cf113464321701f43fb5fc7071b94c75bd0f6b75135b797ebac46ccbceaac609", "ja": "うふふ、そうですね～。レッスンルームに\nこもっていては、気づけませんでしたね～。", "zh": "呵呵，是呀～\n要是窝在练习室，就不会发现原来天气这么好了～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1041_029umi", "source_sha256": "71d43279bedf6cd82319434d232410d3050ccceb54be2302b31063f7cac40f5f", "ja": "あっ、ねえねえ！　みんなで競争しようよ！\nあそこの木に、1番先にタッチした人が優勝ね♪", "zh": "啊，对了对了！大家一起比赛吧！\n最先碰到那边那棵树的人获胜喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1042_029umi", "source_sha256": "a84adc387e3e164842e5e5d42de00a924a838d6c2a7bd5cec6db5300f31a5526", "ja": "もちろん、{$P$}も参加だよ！", "zh": "{$P$}当然也要参加喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1043_p", "source_sha256": "b22a4e3f20a4759df14a4d3cc6e715293fa42986cfdae79bf72a8b7f97e36e5b", "ja": "お、俺もか？", "zh": "我、我也要吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1044_042miy", "source_sha256": "37e5f5b027d87a9e792a4f83164e492b5fb874ab250aa7aa30e9716626fc6d04", "ja": "かけっこするのは、久しぶりですね～。\nその後は、日なたでのんびりするのもいいですな～。", "zh": "好久没有赛跑了呢～\n跑完后在树荫下乘凉也不错呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1045_031tom", "source_sha256": "2cbbb37d60037b7c0b7d4e0c9579598b89cb0c457df36690bf47e67737f90bd3", "ja": "みなさん～。お散歩もいいですが、\nちゃんと公演のことも考えていますか～？", "zh": "各位～散步虽然很不错，\n但你们有认真在思考公演的事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1046_029umi", "source_sha256": "c74a1ec4391463da0ddcfc6b9ad49daff45858427292d425e8efc961b9d0c4f1", "ja": "はっ！　そうだった！？", "zh": "啊！差点忘了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1047_031tom", "source_sha256": "742c52bfbb6ae8d928657f7690e4ee2d1e17aa2c46fdc0515898b39ab74c1691", "ja": "{$P$}さん～？\nしっかり舵取りしてくれないと、困りますよ～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生～\n你要是不好好领导大家，我会很伤脑筋喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1048_031tom", "source_sha256": "7fe6a9c72fb3025a38eb4a592c1834deb9b8924b5ef8ac898bf2f4ff1fb99c9e", "ja": "もし子豚ちゃんを喜ばせられないようなことになれば、\nその時は……わかっていますよね～？", "zh": "如果最后不能让小猪开心，\n到时候……你懂吧～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_1049", "source_sha256": "00628a8b7c67fa416b2ae599bf851d0d59bbb6414ef400f9aa96bd8f9a2e7f91", "ja": "わかってます", "zh": "我知道", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2000_p", "source_sha256": "55aeae8dce8343c8d80fe644c6cd093e999b4596527b7712fb19cf104520819a", "ja": "も、もちろん、わかってるよ。\nアイドルはファンを喜ばせてこそだからな。", "zh": "我、我当然知道，\n毕竟偶像就是要为粉丝带来欢笑嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2001_p", "source_sha256": "ed26275fe001d03cfb03f039b064c4131c87cd87e27fece69a90ff794c1126e4", "ja": "でも、今はもう少し……。\n美也、どうだ？", "zh": "不过，现在就再给她点时间吧……\n美也，怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2002_042miy", "source_sha256": "2eff977e38c5ec7a7e41e7c6d7f91cc550afa63bfd5df24fc6b5d660ba025671", "ja": "そうですね～。色んな人が楽しめる、\nそういう公演でないとダメですよね～。む～ん……。", "zh": "这个嘛～必须要让各种客群都能乐在其中，\n这才是公演的目标对吧～？唔～嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2003_042miy", "source_sha256": "e7c8266f342653e3b487a899cbc9b44b2bcc8a0183af7b5480a5b34ba217313e", "ja": "……おや～？\nこんなところに、松ぼっくりが落ちてますよ～。", "zh": "……哎呀～？\n竟然有松球掉在这种地方～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2004_029umi", "source_sha256": "5b5daa8dcc6eb7e5a9fff191e87faa56045929272e3d9a4548a1d760b3d831a8", "ja": "えっ、どこどこ！？\nわ、ホントだ！　大きいっ！", "zh": "咦，哪里哪里！？\n哇，真的耶！好大一颗！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2005_042miy", "source_sha256": "2a37ea05a0c86d495666efa6c10d7c04aedd1ab9100119410c4ec53d5d2a0e90", "ja": "コロコロしてて、かわいいですね～。\nお土産に、持って帰りましょうか～。", "zh": "圆滚滚的真可爱呢～\n要不要带回去当作纪念品呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2006_042miy", "source_sha256": "152af810d29801acad24aab3e344dc6e0e5a49feaabe1ac8deb092a28f20be9b", "ja": "……お～。こっちには、新芽が生えてきていますよ～。", "zh": "……哦～这边长出新芽了耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2007_042miy", "source_sha256": "e2b22eb4a746505a2fcc04dcbef2e80161a181d0ed40faf7ff644582da6c1260", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\nこれは何というお花か、わかりますか～？", "zh": "{$P$}先生，\n你知道这朵花叫什么吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2008_p", "source_sha256": "e9b79ee952d1952a3880d5d3633b1df9affec29fcb07e8a3a750ae910efe0d2f", "ja": "う～ん、なんだろう？\n花の名前には、そんなに詳しくなくて……。", "zh": "唔～是叫什么呢？\n我对花的名字不是特别了解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2009_042miy", "source_sha256": "ae1352e82d3f3253310a135f46e45516e3b266e82ba7feb4b3b6620206276fd5", "ja": "朋花ちゃんは、知っていますか～？", "zh": "朋花你知道吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2010_031tom", "source_sha256": "bb400d37aa4db19e31b0c57cbaaedef681518eaad92550d6be200307f8285269", "ja": "そうですね～、花は好きなほうですが……\n残念ながら、このお花の名前はわかりませんね～。", "zh": "这个嘛～我算是喜欢花的人……\n但很可惜，我不知道这朵花的名字～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2011_042miy", "source_sha256": "8cc5f1121578e1c6090ee1efcc987bb7cdf10b28e9fd2cd39165577f2a86f39c", "ja": "そうですか～。……ではこのお花の名前は、\n咲いてからのお楽しみという事ですな～。", "zh": "这样啊……那这朵花的名字，\n要等它开花后才能揭晓了呢～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2012_031tom", "source_sha256": "b46f54fa8a0d33169f31d1f9ec09312e7f1d87834b8f2a5ec13dae4c91cfd51a", "ja": "お花が咲く頃に、またみんなで、\nお散歩に来るといいかもしれませんね～。ふふふ。", "zh": "等花开的时候大家再一起来散步，\n或许会很不错呢～呵呵呵。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2013_029umi", "source_sha256": "7880acac0a8eae2321f17f8b8f00e5025e16aa79e7f203d2d7610d8aed20f41b", "ja": "さんせーい！\nじゃあその時も、みんなで来ようね！", "zh": "我赞成──！\n那到时候我们几个也要一起来喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2014_042miy", "source_sha256": "1e3b2e9ea15faa5cc63141acc406bfb09edf48ac2769f62a5a622ef9914945a8", "ja": "はい～、約束ですよ～。\nお花見、楽しみですね～。", "zh": "好～约好了喔～\n好期待赏花呀～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2015_p", "source_sha256": "89bfa88c396f57e20ae804a59a93b17cf0dc879341d6c2fb4806fb7a6a3da4b9", "ja": "（……なんだろうな。いつの間にか海美も朋花も、\n美也のペースに巻き込まれているような……）", "zh": "（……怎么回事呢？海美和朋花好像不知不觉间，\n都被美也的步调给影响了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2016_009rit", "source_sha256": "44ac2ca7aeb46456bf661cfc2099de39fb8a7db67debefc35d40494d576af88c", "ja": "あら？　{$P$}じゃないですか。\nそれに、美也に海美、朋花も。", "zh": "哎呀？这不是{$P$}吗？\n美也、海美和朋花也在。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2017_029umi", "source_sha256": "44f780f312e75f137269a6dd6c13e244c7d3486d50f8f166b95cc499c0f851ab", "ja": "えっ？　わっ、律子さんと貴音さんだ！\nやっほー！", "zh": "咦？哇，是律子姊和贵音！\n嗨──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2018_008tak", "source_sha256": "8fe966302528c7681c0054afa2e99e16692915999ce366a5ae91a19b9878f990", "ja": "海美、今日も元気がいいのですね。\n皆でお散歩ですか？", "zh": "海美，你今天也很有活力呢。\n大家在一起散步吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2019_p", "source_sha256": "8603e915111b244082a449da53cf62297b1bf2f7e472cb9e863a550ea6524272", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。\n貴音と律子は、今日の仕事はもう終わりか？", "zh": "嗯，是啊。\n贵音和律子今天的工作已经结束了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2020_008tak", "source_sha256": "8ea716ce6d64cff6d26175b26f68cf5872475928bab97d26edb5efd1e78ef83a", "ja": "はい。先ほど終わりましたので、\nこれから劇場に向かうところでした。", "zh": "是的，稍早刚忙完，\n接下来正要前往剧场。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2021_009rit", "source_sha256": "b69c767353559e29ca5b1a70b402ef2bb764116c012d7a07631087f520b578f8", "ja": "ここのところ、かなり忙しかったですからね～。\n気分転換に、公園で緑を眺めて行こうかと思いまして。", "zh": "最近特别忙碌呢～\n所以我们想转换心情，来公园眺望一下绿意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2022_p", "source_sha256": "c9512383bfa6264fb4063c6c5ec1a1be7f22c2ea047939f7e53a8bb57989d0a0", "ja": "そういえば……悪いな、ふたりとも。\n厳しいスケジュールになってしまって。", "zh": "这么说起来……真是不好意思，\n害得你们两个人的行程变得这么紧凑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2023_009rit", "source_sha256": "e0724985b7a614d446a314b677b34a9286080710372ea78cd3d777590af5cf38", "ja": "とんでもない、アイドルは忙しくてこそ、ですから。\nありがたいことです♪", "zh": "别这么说，偶像就是要忙碌才好呀。\n行程紧凑是件好事♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2024_009rit", "source_sha256": "61fa23a68e8068e67ccbe691051950f9896eb4d80dae1443e607f0db3d702b8f", "ja": "あれ？　でも美也たちは、散歩してて大丈夫なの？\n次の公演のレッスン、始まったばかりじゃなかった？", "zh": "咦？但是美也你们出来散步没问题吗？\n下次公演的练习不是才刚开始？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2025_042miy", "source_sha256": "a3d8185c93482afa3a579bbbe21f0dafa9909d712c7c7b590e13d6bb16ba5318", "ja": "はい～。その公演のことを、考えていまして～。\nいいアイディアが出なかったので、気分転換に～。", "zh": "是的～我正在思考那场公演的事～\n因为想不到好主意，才出来转换心情～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2026_031tom", "source_sha256": "72cf8c463106fe3152d599975e30a144a7a95957280d3f1e16315b0d6610ecbd", "ja": "美也さんがセンターの公演なので、\nステージプランを考えているんですよ～。", "zh": "这次公演是美也担任Center，\n所以她正在构思舞台计划～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2027_008tak", "source_sha256": "784cb4a7d80d0ebd3f5daba3b2eceac86172258ffe6ec2246699cb0122d7748e", "ja": "なるほど、それで公園に来たというわけですね。\n良き判断だと思います。", "zh": "原来如此，所以各位才会来到公园啊。\n小女子认为这是明智的判断。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2028_008tak", "source_sha256": "3a6f2c70c58391089fe6d2fede88db75c3d44593366960989bb8f3baf39e749c", "ja": "広々とした場所で、自然に身をゆだねることで……\nやがて心も静まり、様々な物事が見えてくるものです。", "zh": "来到广阔的地方，将自己交给大自然……\n心灵也会跟着平静，便能看清很多事物。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2029_009rit", "source_sha256": "f5930cd360e8fa1c4712c6ef1ce99ed6cee20f2ac62ba80a8bea6cb9c7b56a8f", "ja": "うーん。ま、そうよね。\n気を抜いてばっかりなのは困りモノだけど……。", "zh": "唔～这么说也对啦。\n不过要是时时刻刻都处在松懈状态可就伤脑筋啰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2030_009rit", "source_sha256": "0cece990dfdc0975bb09597c3fa2a9dac142b2e408acff68e5e8c18c1390293a", "ja": "肩ひじ張ってるばかりじゃ、息も詰まるし。\nそんな疲れた顔、ファンに見せても仕方ないものね♪", "zh": "但一直绷紧神经也会让人喘不过气。\n露出那种疲惫的表情给粉丝看也没意义呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2032_p", "source_sha256": "2fd7a6600e0838947728d98ae3570a5baa637e89d0660b7700eb991104ff41a3", "ja": "美也？", "zh": "美也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2033_042miy", "source_sha256": "964d6fd4d70d2f6d9f61a28f9821879577e76a9dbad0eb83432651dac5897d91", "ja": "ふむふむ……わかりましたよ～。", "zh": "嗯嗯……我明白了喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2034_029umi", "source_sha256": "6d1d544a760425131afacf2622e3626631b8ec8f444510f7f02109b9104e3485", "ja": "な、何がわかったの、美也？", "zh": "你、你明白什么了，美也？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_2035", "source_sha256": "603bf1414a0fb482841c84b175276e2bd1c268992d90877746992cb3e8c946ad", "ja": "見つかった？", "zh": "你有新发现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3000_p", "source_sha256": "6e195c3e58dc2d7a567a1b1b75aae749f82b5b65633f313662d40b65bb73a60a", "ja": "美也、公演のこと……\n何か見つかったのか？", "zh": "美也，关于公演……\n你有什么新发现了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3001_042miy", "source_sha256": "57eeb9092d58abbdbd4bc362e3e8d70acfc60aaf5594460cd0b0b4684923424f", "ja": "はい～。公演も、お散歩と一緒ですね～。\n楽しくお散歩することにしましょう～。", "zh": "是的～公演跟散步是一样的呢～\n就让这场公演变成愉快的散步吧～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3002_042miy", "source_sha256": "2fec99fe859fa4ad005e5cf4ab307c9fce82f068bd984142fca28daf8cbad8e5", "ja": "ただ、ゴールがないと迷子になってしまいます～。\nでも、これでもう安心ですよ～。", "zh": "只是没有终点就会迷路～\n不过，这下就可以放心啰～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3003_029umi", "source_sha256": "686108b448d12562019314611a8736b5139bbbdf79d922f17c3594e320d88825", "ja": "……えっ、どういうこと？\n美也、つまり、どういうこと？？", "zh": "……咦，什么意思？\n美也，所以你是指什么意思？？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3004_031tom", "source_sha256": "345092b707decf6a49fa75088d672ea341d4d6e64634630680164f173943d9e9", "ja": "美也さんの中で、公演で何をやりたいのか固まった、\nということではないでしょうか～？", "zh": "是不是在美也心里，\n想在公演里表演什么已经有个雏型了呢～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3005_029umi", "source_sha256": "afc3195014c75be76f338e87699cc19b97ad2dbe2a6762b0c9ccd5658fe23106", "ja": "そっか！　どおりで美也、\nなんだかキラキラしてるって思った！", "zh": "这样啊！\n难怪美也看起来闪闪发光！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3006_p", "source_sha256": "23dffb180a44136426f643c7d678d71003c8390481a00b64ab768373882ca56b", "ja": "（そうか。きっと公演でも、\nみんなで楽しく散歩した、今日のように……）", "zh": "（原来如此。即使是在公演上，\n她肯定也想跟大家开心散步，就像今天一样……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3007_042miy", "source_sha256": "ee9eefa5c30c60c6ed5bd4bf1c4143d7b35d8be2546faf8ddcc7bdc5f553e781", "ja": "律子さん、貴音さん、\nありがとうございました～。", "zh": "律子姊、贵音，\n谢谢你们～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3008_009rit", "source_sha256": "e579fbb01838539d315c82f8ff4a2461ba21b0039efc414f3a3c37fc8b80391b", "ja": "え？　ううん、どういたしましてっ。\n力になれたのなら良かったわ。公演、がんばってね！", "zh": "咦？哪里，不用客气。\n我很高兴有帮上你的忙，公演要加油喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3009_009rit", "source_sha256": "1b7890b29ba579ff09a1397a0dcbcd11a757321cc88e5eca8058d934ed04a860", "ja": "……ねえ、貴音、さっきの私たち、\nなにかいいこと言った？", "zh": "……欸，贵音，\n我们刚才有说什么好意见吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3010_008tak", "source_sha256": "7f50a5521c1dc9494015d7cf5788b391bd07455e2bfeaf6d8757435fe5ea9ca8", "ja": "ふふっ、どうでしょう。散歩に賛同しただけ\nだったようには思いますが……。", "zh": "呵呵，谁知道呢。\n在小女子看来似乎只有赞同散步而已……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3011_008tak", "source_sha256": "94d1273077812fb592989066e715f334350edc38b8e51a4e8f2ca5810279aca0", "ja": "言葉は、受け取り方ひとつで意味を変えるもの。\n宮尾美也が何かを見出したのなら、めでたきことです。", "zh": "不过，语言会随听者的解读而改变意义。\n宫尾美也如果能从中发掘什么，那是值得高兴的事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3012_042miy", "source_sha256": "dd3faa14d303441a3e5ff30939fb99324e5f1c9c9abda83641f441a5927bf8a0", "ja": "海美ちゃんも朋花ちゃんも、\nそれから{$P$}さんも。", "zh": "海美和朋花，\n还有{$P$}先生。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3013_042miy", "source_sha256": "3ace24bf158d21d1878944e496c9f2e0ddcb64cc9d8e9553b6fee95bf4f1bda2", "ja": "お散歩に付き合ってくれて、\nありがとうございました～。", "zh": "谢谢你们陪我散步～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3014_029umi", "source_sha256": "159df0d70bc883df8ae8150d196af74e72e96e9d2716b135810b0a0562dc8774", "ja": "ううん、私も楽しかったよ♪\n公演では、一緒に会場中を盛り上げようね！", "zh": "哪里，我也很开心喔♪\n让我们在公演一起带动整个会场的气氛吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3015_031tom", "source_sha256": "2b1c0410460269bf652caff3393b917fa3e24f32d001d79c810e6c8670b5c679", "ja": "そうですね～。子豚ちゃん達を\nたくさん鳴かせてあげましょう～♪", "zh": "说得对～\n我们一起让小猪们尖叫连连吧～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3016_p", "source_sha256": "fd3cae07e3758e3acd541b230707dc5600c281a1bb5994da4edf5d21d13daae5", "ja": "美也、今日は楽しい散歩ができて良かったよ。\nこの調子で、センター公演も頼んだぞ！", "zh": "美也，今天能开心散步真是太好了。\n继续保持这个步调，Center公演还要拜托你啰！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3017_042miy", "source_sha256": "c51ce938d419584223bb278419dac8b951e3b7766e16d82668c9681691b128e5", "ja": "はい～。楽しい公演にしてみせますからね～。\nむふふ～。", "zh": "好的～我一定会打造一场开心的公演～\n呵呵呵～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3018_p", "source_sha256": "3d419d577cd53d1f21a3584593c0030aed62cad903357261aed6ed7aca83fea0", "ja": "（美也が探していたものは、案外近くにあったらしい。\n楽しく散歩するような公演……）", "zh": "（看来美也在寻找的东西，其实就近在眼前。\n如同开心散步般的公演……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "main_befo_020_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_befo_020_3019_p", "source_sha256": "f7d6652338f10b785c530f1dfdb387fe1da8515955ca4b1f6d08cc7e19526086", "ja": "（どんなゴールにたどり着くのか、\nしっかり見届けるとしよう！）", "zh": "（她会抵达什么样的终点，\n我要好好看到最后！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
